cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use JaisCloud in your research or tooling, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "JaisCloud — Free AWS Emulator"
abstract: >
  JaisCloud is a free, open-source AWS emulator written in Go. It implements
  the exact AWS wire protocols (Query/XML, JSON/Target, REST/XML, REST/JSON)
  so any AWS SDK points at a local instance without code changes. Key features
  include a single static binary with zero runtime dependencies, PostgreSQL
  persistence, state snapshots, real Spark/EMR execution via Kubernetes or
  Docker, multi-account isolation, and Prometheus metrics — all free under
  Apache 2.0.
